==Description==
The '''Lovely Crate''' is a seasonal crate, which means that it only appears during a specific period of time, in this case during Valentine's Day. This crate yields nine Valentine-themed skins, with some of them being old skins taken from the [[Valentines Crate]] or the [[Season of Love]]. It could have been purchased for {{Coins|4,000}} in the store. Skins from this crate could have also appeared in the [[Daily Store#Daily Skin Store|Daily Skin Store]].

Each skin that can be gotten from the '''Lovely Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the Daily Skin Store. In the Daily Skin Store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Coins|4,000}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins cost {{Coins|4,500}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|5,500}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|7,000}}.

The '''Lovely Crate''' is a black and pink-brown color striped chest with two wings on the side. A red heart lock can be found on the chest, which is used to open the crate with a golden heart key.

