==Trivia==
*The {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}} [[Sniper]] is the only skin from the [[Valentines Crate]] that was added to this crate.
**Weirdly, the {{Color|Lovely|Valentines}} [[Sniper]] was removed from the [[Valentines Crate]] alongside the [[Season of Love]] skins when the '''Lovely Crate''' was added, despite the skin originally being from that crate.
*Despite being taken offsale, the '''Lovely Crate''' is still advertised in the home section of the store.
**Additionally, the cost of the '''Lovely Crate''' is listed there as {{Coins|5,000}}, despite it actually having a cost of {{Coins|4,000}}.

